# CLAUDE.md

The rules for working in this repo and the full context of the challenge are imported below.
Follow `AGENTS.md` in every session. The live state (`docs/STATUS.md`, newest `docs/LOG.md`
entries) is printed by the SessionStart hook; if you do not see it, run `scripts/session-start`.

